Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,burning bright For what's ahead you\Nsee Is beyond your wildest dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.36,0:01:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The best that we know. With tears\Nand doubts and tone. We'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,where we all wanna go The page\Nwithin brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you nice and toasty
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.06,0:02:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you nice and crispy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take me straight\Nto the inner castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me fly you\Naround when I'm injured, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This better be important.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Beast Pirate\Nsaid that some sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.78,0:02:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,giant apparition appeared\Non the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spreading fire through the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Be ready for the worst. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The ten samurai are blocking the exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck! Step back! We got a cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire is spreading everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Secure an escape route!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're through those samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here\Nor we'll burn to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, young\Nmaster, it's a sweet deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me out for a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't regret it, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving on to the next\Ntarget, you little weasel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't buy into your plans\Nso you suck up the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.24,0:03:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.18,0:03:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I have somewhere to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop following me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to yell at you\Nback there, but I'm in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nouga, Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure wish I could be as carefree as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an urgent report\Nfor all castle floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The giant plane creature is\Ncurrently headed for the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A cushion? Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hairs, but I don't know whose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we have to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A ball of flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.16,0:04:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.82,0:05:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The slave creature's\Nintentions are still unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, run! It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, it's descending through\Nthe floors at a steady pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems impervious to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take extreme caution!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pulling his crust.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to make fun of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I hit like a laser beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to block!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In ancient times, this is\Nhow pteranodons hunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, you're my prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, I don't know my dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta hit him with something\Nor he's just gonna wear me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'm guessing that flame on your back\Nmust be a Pteranodon thing too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're the one\Nwith the stupid powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just gonna keep trash-talking\Ntill he picks me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to knock that\Nbastard out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:07:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't even leave a dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, dinosaurs have skin tough as steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like dragons, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have far more than just tough skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My powers are unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a sword fight if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I do enjoy a good duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut him, but he doesn't bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.68,0:08:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,His wings are strong.\NThey're agile too, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.32,0:08:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,like he uses them more to attack than fly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the flame on his back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Keeps burning. I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that was part of his Devil Fruit power but
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe not. He could be\Na fish man part giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,or anything under that\Nmask Heli might even
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Be something I've never\Nheard of. I see confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,in your eyes you're looking for an answer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.86,0:09:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,this is not good
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to think if
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't figure him out I'm screwed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can beat him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A shamisen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Enmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Music?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is playing a shamasing, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a battleground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming from the room next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The banquet is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They shall be running for their lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorosaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dreaming, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Either that or I'm dead
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've thought about you\Nevery night since that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrible day. You've never\Nleft my mind for an instant,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,my dear Nor have you left my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.72,0:11:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:12:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I will be by your\Nside until the very end
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is a dream, I\Ndon't want to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.20,0:12:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving through the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Into the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Into the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a message to all warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.12,0:13:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The flame creature is continuing\Nits descent to the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire is spreading along\Nwith it, so make caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A flame creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's headed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it'll reach\Nthe armory before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about to be a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to set off\Nall of those explosives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.94,0:13:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you help me with something, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow me! Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had it my way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd take a nap in this fellow's hair\Nand wake up when this disaster is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But life's not so simple, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We've bought some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but they can't be far Then they'll\Nbe after us soon We should hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.08,0:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll catch you soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be front page news!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lapdogs of the Celestial Dragon\Nspotted at Kaido's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a scoop, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,One little call to mortgages This\Npirate's gonna be rolling in the dough
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it's on. Well, I can\Nsee it now. After losing their
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,arms brokered Doflamingo The\Ngovernment makes their play
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Appu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Diaz Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly who you are\Nand what you're trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'd better cook up\Na damn good cover story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How inconvenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll erase you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of pugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You stinking assassins can suck it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure they\Nstruck you dead. Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I got armament Haki just like anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, they're gonna pay\Nfor screwing with me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I just saved some\Ndumbass traitor from the Navy stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bang, are you gonna\Nend this or is it all me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ended I didn't even start it man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did these guys suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You better believe I'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.52,0:17:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Enma!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say you could unleash your power!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a falling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.78,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now show me your worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.15,0:18:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jackpot! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.36,0:18:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to eavesdrop, but you were\Ntalking to the pirate hunter, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's never going\Nto be king, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be dead if I didn't\Nuse my armament in Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That was one hell of an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Was he planning on dying with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That looked like a suicide attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Except he doesn't have a scratch on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,King is a Lunarian, a race that was\Nthought to have gone extinct long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're monsters who are able to\Nsurvive in all natural environments.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.42,0:19:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past, they were known as gods, if\Nyou want an idea of how strong they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're so special, why\Ndid they become extinct?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a scientist, not a history creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,One sword style, E.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Death, lion, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't face him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep ramping up, but you\Ndon't even bother to block.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.60,0:21:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The music again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Emma, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.10,0:21:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Share your deep pride! Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get me killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A swordsman getting held\Nback by his own sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.30,0:21:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.14,0:21:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ketensu, the bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.62,0:22:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This sword's cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.24,0:22:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll take it. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sell it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if something happens\Nto you with that sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.44,0:22:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the curse could come\Nback to me, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Then how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.90,0:22:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll play a little game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.88,0:22:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you've become quite adept.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems as though Enma\Nhas met a worthy owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.66,0:22:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You already wield Kitetsu III.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's one of mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.26,0:22:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really gonna\Ndie to save your sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.72,0:23:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado Ichimonji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.10,0:23:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I ask that you\Nlet me have her sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.88,0:23:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's yours then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.32,0:23:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll get stronger\Nfor both of us, Kuina.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.08,0:24:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be so strong that my name\Nreaches up to the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.10,0:24:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the world's greatest\Nswordsman, no matter what it takes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.96,0:24:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.87,0:24:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,have you not questioned\Nwhy the famed Blade Lady
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.00,0:24:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyori left you feel so\Ncomfortable in your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.66,0:24:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It works much like a cursive blade does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.48,0:24:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The weak cannot handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Though there is a much bigger reason why\Nit feels familiar to you as you wield it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.90,0:24:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You may find this shocking,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but your Wado Ichimonji and Enma\Nwere crafted by the very same man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.68,0:24:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the legendary\Nblacksmith Shimoski Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.22,0:24:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought to question\Nthis sword's origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.52,0:24:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did a blade from\Nthe land of Wano end
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.90,0:24:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,up in the East Blue in\Nthe middle of nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.80,0:25:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Got all your swords back, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.88,0:25:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Swings and Arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.34,0:25:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Enma!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.26,0:26:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A sword from the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.68,0:26:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A sword from the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.72,0:26:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro Juro.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.74,0:26:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The word Tsunachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.92,0:26:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku advised me against using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.74,0:26:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.18,0:26:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Some old guy from my\Nvillage told me years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.38,0:26:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't really say I've used it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.04,0:26:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That old man from the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.78,0:26:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He was always sitting by\Nhimself looking at the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.54,0:27:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know his name,\Nbut he told me all these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.60,0:27:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.90,0:27:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunachi, it is a word that means good\Nluck and can uplift your spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.72,0:27:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.74,0:27:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My spirits are doing fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need any weird tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.04,0:28:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So anyway, I wanted to ask you,\Ndid you used to be a samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.56,0:28:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,cuz that's what everyone at\Nthe dojo is saying then tell
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.68,0:28:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Them to shut up if word gets\Nup then the Navy's gonna come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.54,0:28:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,knocking I don't get it the
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.28,0:28:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Navy I'm done talking go home you
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.28,0:28:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.19,0:28:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.32,0:28:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You old weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.18,0:28:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dojo kick you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.72,0:28:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you just bored?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.22,0:28:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to get some\Nmore sword practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.82,0:28:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Clan kicked my butt like she always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.64,0:28:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.55,0:28:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't pay for these.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.56,0:28:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.84,0:28:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're blunt, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.78,0:28:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A damn shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.82,0:28:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I make these days
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.40,0:29:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,turns out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.40,0:29:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're fine for practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.92,0:29:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.60,0:29:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A sword's not a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.08,0:29:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's made to kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.62,0:29:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an instrument of\Ndeath and nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.18,0:29:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The job of a swordsmith is to make\Ntheir blades as deadly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.34,0:29:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We deal in murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.14,0:29:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Every sword has its own personality\Nand some are quite willful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.90,0:29:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a swordsman's job to tame them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.00,0:29:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If a sword is too dangerous,\Npeople say it's cursed!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.38,0:29:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What a load of crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.36,0:29:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a sign of quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.70,0:29:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the weak fear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.62,0:29:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A swordsman bends it to his\Nwill, calling it cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.40,0:29:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,is a badge of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.12,0:29:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Swords should be terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.58,0:29:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Their only purpose is to take lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.66,0:30:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, they yearn for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.16,0:30:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a sword that\NI made when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.08,0:30:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A true masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.10,0:30:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In all my years since, I've\Nnever been able to top it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.86,0:30:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The sword had a stern personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.20,0:30:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When you held it in your hand,\Nit set a shiver down your spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.40,0:30:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how fine a blade it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.60,0:30:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's named after the great\Nking who presides over hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.40,0:30:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The great king who presides over hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.04,0:30:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Enma...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.22,0:31:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The village was named Shemotski.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.90,0:31:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.88,0:31:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know until the day\Nthat old man died, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.28,0:31:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out he was Kuina's grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.72,0:31:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want me to give your famed\Nblade back, you've got to catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.18,0:31:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a famed blade,\Nit's just a practice sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.98,0:31:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, I heard something crazy! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.98,0:31:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This will blow your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.24,0:31:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandma told me this village\Nwas founded by a pirate! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.18,0:31:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.02,0:31:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the legendary\Nblacksmith, Shimotsuki Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.48,0:31:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke the laws of this\Ncountry and took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.84,0:31:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Last anyone saw him was 50 years back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.76,0:31:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That old man was a samurai\Nfrom the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.40,0:32:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The famous blacksmith, Shimotsuki Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.20,0:32:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Find swords, watch us humans closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.98,0:32:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're looking\Nfor the right partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.32,0:32:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, they say\Nthe sword chooses the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.52,0:32:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.68,0:32:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to me because\Nyou wanted to test me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.24,0:32:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So it doesn't have malice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.44,0:32:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't doing this to harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.52,0:32:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that means my power is still lacking
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.32,0:32:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin milled you with\Nease Even though you took
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.86,0:33:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,away so much Haki I wish\NI could have seen that
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.86,0:33:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Enma. One more round!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.74,0:33:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We got him now. The pirate\Nhunter's going down! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.12,0:33:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard's in bad shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.48,0:33:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Master King!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.39,0:33:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.86,0:33:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We want a shot at zero too!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.98,0:33:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.30,0:33:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We take him out, we'll get promoted!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.16,0:33:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.14,0:33:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.70,0:33:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.24,0:33:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to stabilize my Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.42,0:33:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm releasing too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.36,0:33:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die if I keep this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.82,0:33:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.14,0:33:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.66,0:33:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.20,0:34:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Fancy yourself a conqueror, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.92,0:34:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay, the world's\Ngreatest swordsman, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.50,0:34:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, when it comes to crewmates,\Nas the next king of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.88,0:34:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.64,0:34:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.90,0:34:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I made a promise to my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.32,0:34:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My captain and best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.90,0:34:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You
